    Report SKIP action when analyze-tracks/select-tracks find no matching tracks (#8021)
    
    Fixes #1864.
    
    Both operations returned CONTINUE even when no tracks matched the
    configured source flavor, so the admin UI could not show them as skipped
    despite doing nothing.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Probably does not even need testing tbh.
    
    ### AI Usage
    
    Claude Sonnet 5 was used to change CONTINUE to SKIP (yes I was that
    lazy).
    
